Reset 3's pstore `console-ramoops-0` (the boot that ended in the batch-3 run-35 reset): its
head (boot banner, kernel command line) and its last 80 lines (the mmc_rescan hung-task
episode and the heartbeat up to the stop). 861 lines, 91236 bytes total; md5
5a575b6fc3ef10b5b90b0f49ba637f0f -- matches the full record described in reset3-findings.md.
The MAC on the command line is redacted; the full 861-line copy is not committed. Mounted
read-only (`mount -t pstore -o ro pstore /sys/fs/pstore`), copied, unmounted; nothing in pstore
was deleted.

